What is the output of the following function for the input [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]?

```python
def fn(queue):
    q = deque(queue)
    size = len(q)
    stack = []

    for _ in range(size // 2):
        stack.append(q.popleft())

    while stack:
        q.append(stack.pop())

    for _ in range(size // 2):
        q.append(q.popleft())
        q.append(q.popleft())

    return list(q)
```

